OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondoners report 130 hours of
OL,4,Adelays on Tube line
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers on the Wimbledon to East
OL,7,FPutney stretch of the District line
OL,8,Fhave said the issues on the line were
OL,9,Fcausing people to change jobs to avoid
OL,10,Fhaving to use it, and that infrequent
OL,11,Fservices and regular signalling
OL,12,Fproblems at stations had become an
OL,13,Feveryday frustration, campaigners told
OL,14,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,16,FTransport for London said it had
OL,17,Finvested about #500,000 to improve the
OL,18,Fsignalling infrastructure.
